  "plain": "Diana Pasulka, a researcher who appeared on a podcast about UFOs and religion, says that in the 2010s in the United States some people asked her to look into the subject. She says she later learned they belonged to what she calls the Invisible College: a loose group of scientists, some from the aerospace world, who quietly study UFOs. If true, it would mean serious scientists were studying the topic behind the scenes and reaching out to scholars."
